	(text "TC52 wireless: MDBT50Q-1MV2 (nRF52840) + 1S LiPo version of the wired TC52 capacitive keyboard.\nSheet mdbt50q: module, charger, USB, SWD, reset, encoder.  Sheet ec: 52 electrodes, MUX x2, analog front end.\nThe sheets are joined by global labels: ROW1..4_DRV, INHA/S1A..S3A, INHB/S1B..S3B, SENSE (purge, P1.02),\nADC (AIN4 = P0.28), AFE_EN (P0.13), ENC_A / ENC_B / ENC_SW, +3V3 (module VDD = REG0 output), GND.\nPin table and firmware notes: docs/tc52w-build-log.md"
